 rightsizing the field force.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2018 Q2","e":"incy","d":"2018-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Lawson","x":"Anything in that beat over second half around pricing, volume, competition that kind of held you back from raising guidance?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2018 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2018-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barry P. Flannelly","x":"Well, we took a 3% price increase at the beginning of September, and historically, we've seen after we take a price increase that inventory does go down, but generally it's gradually over time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2018 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2018-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven H. Stein","x":"We'll get the right size in and get the right safety database to do that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2018 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2019-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"As you know, we took a 4% price increase at the very end of 2018.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2019 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Abrahams","x":"What's the right way to think about the cost savings from the bari restructuring?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2019 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2019-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"In terms of Q4, we reiterated the guidance that we provided on both R&D and SG&A because there is a timing factor for some of the expenses on both lines that we expect to be more back-end loaded into Q4 of 2019 and, therefore, we continue to be comfortable with the initial guidance that we have…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2020 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"Patient demand remains strong, and as a result, we are reiterating our guidance for the full year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2020 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tazeen Ahmad","x":"And what part of maintaining guidance assumes that, that proportion stays the same.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2020 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2020-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven Stein","x":"We are reiterating our guidance for both R&D and SG&A. As a reminder, the R&D guidance excludes the $805 million up front consideration related to our collaboration with MorphoSys and the $120 million of expense related to the purchase of the FDA priority review voucher.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2021 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2021-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"Therefore, we are very confident in our full-year outlook for Jakafi and are reaffirming our guidance of $2.125 billion to $2.2 billion.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2021 Q2","e":"incy","d":"2021-08-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"So there are certain activities that were related, for example, to direct-to-consumer that we were planning to do this year once we launch that now, given the timing we don't anticipate doing this year anymore and will be pushed now to 2022.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2021 Q2","e":"incy","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Berens","x":"Just to clarify Mara’s question, was any of the lowered SG&A guidance that you announced today related to a delay and headcount reduction or hiring?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2021 Q2","e":"incy","d":"2021-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"Based on the strong performance of Pemazyre in the first half of 2021, we are increasing the guidance range for other hematology oncology to a $155 million to $170 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2021 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2021-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"And we are reiterating our full-year guidance range of $2.125 billion to $2.17 billion.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2021 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2022-02-08","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"In terms of the SG&A guidance, it does reflect all costs associated with commercializing and marketing and supporting the Opzelura launch, so including DTC.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2021 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2022-02-08","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Marc Frahm","x":"On the guidance on the SG&A side, Christiana, in previous prior conversations, you and Barry have talked about possible need for DTC ads here, is that already contemplated in the guidance or no?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2022-11-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"…patients who are currently not seeking treatment, we are launching several initiatives, including direct-to-consumer campaigns, patient advocacy group engagements, and branded patient meetings to raise awareness and encourage those patients to seek treatment now that there is a new approved…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2022-11-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"Well, we are already doing DTC for vitiligo in a variety of locations, of course, through social media, things like Facebook, Instagram and so forth in terms of Internet search optimization.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2022-11-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"So, the DTC is going on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2022-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Leonid Timashev","x":"Do you think you’ll have to give back a lot of any potential price increases you might take into gross to net?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2023-02-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"We are already seeing high awareness and excitement for Opzelura from patients, and we will continue to build on that momentum throughout the year, including the commencement of TV direct-to-consumer this quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2023-02-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"We haven't started linear and nonlinear TV commercials, direct-to-consumer TV commercials for vitiligo yet.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2023-02-07","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"There's direct-to-consumer activities going on online, on social media, on Internet searches.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2022 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2023-02-07","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Allison Bratzel","x":"Or is this not really expected to be a driver until vitiligo specific DTC is underway?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2023 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2023-05-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"We launched our first TV Direct-to-Consumer Campaign for Vitiligo on February 12th this year, and early data supports the success we've had in just a few weeks.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2023 Q2","e":"incy","d":"2023-08-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"But we do want to -- part of our entire effort for any direct to consumer activity is really just to let those patients who want to have their vitiligo treated to know that there is a treatment available for the very first time that can actually help them to repigment their skin.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2023 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2023-10-31","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Barry Flannelly","x":"We are also continuing to roll out DTC initiatives in vitiligo, which is building awareness, driving demand and activating patients to discuss treatment options with their dermatologist.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2023 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2024-02-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"We expect net product revenue growth to be driven exclusively by continued demand growth, and be partially offset by lower net pricing as a result of IRA imposed price increase caps and continued growth in 340B volumes.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2024 Q2","e":"incy","d":"2024-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"Total SG&A expenses were $306 million for the second quarter, representing an 8% year-over-year increase primarily driven by $22 million of expense related to accelerated vesting for certain Escient stock awards and severance payments in connection with the acquisition of the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2024 Q2","e":"incy","d":"2024-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pablo Cagnoni","x":"The retifanlimab data did not have an impact on the pipeline restructuring.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2024 Q4","e":"incy","d":"2025-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"We expect net product revenue growth to be driven exclusively by continued demand growth, primarily in PV, and be partially offset by lower net pricing as a result of IRA-imposed price increase caps and continued growth in 340B volumes.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2025-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Herve Hoppenot","x":"Finally, before I turn the call to Christiana, I would like to address the topic of tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2025-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Herve Hoppenot","x":"Therefore, we expect the impact to Incyte Corporation of any potential tariffs on pharmaceuticals to be minimal.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2025-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"We are increasing our full year guidance for Jakafi from a range of $2.925 to $2.975 billion to a new range of $2.95 to $3 billion.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q1","e":"incy","d":"2025-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christiana Stamoulis","x":"We are reiterating our full year guidance for Obselura, our other hematology oncology products, COGS, R&D, and SG&A. For R&D, our guidance excludes the impact of the recent deal we signed with Genesis, which is expected to add $15 million to our full year R&D spend.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pablo J. Cagnoni","x":"By continuing to streamline our pipeline, we will be able to accelerate and prioritize the programs with the greatest potential impact to patients and to drive future growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/incyte-incy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Meury","x":"We will streamline costs where possible, but not underfund critical initiatives and compromise growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/incyte-incy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William Meury","x":"Based on this momentum, we're raising our full-year guidance for Jakafi to a new range of $3.05 billion to $3.075 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/incyte-incy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"INCY 2025 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William Meury","x":"Sales for Monjuvi in follicular lymphoma, and Zynyz in SCAC, both launched this year, saw strong growth and contributed to our raised guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/incyte-incy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"INCY 2026 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Pablo Cagnoni","x":"We are raising our full-year guidance for OPZELURA, hematology and oncology, and total net sales based on the strong performance delivered through the first nine months of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/incyte-incy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"INCY 2026 Q3","e":"incy","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management"